{"id":"n57823-1-12","stage":5,"title":"무력 · 武力","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57823-1-12-1","ko":"우리나라 군대를 해외로 보낸대요.","zh":"听说我们国家的军队要被派往海外呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리나라","meaning":"我们，咱们；国，国家","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；나라：国，国家。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"},{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리나라","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3"}},{"text":"군대를","meaning":"部队，军队","explanation":"군대：部队，军队；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"군대","audio":"/audio/05ea65477ab09b876055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60101","senseId":"1","lemma":"군대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"군대를","audio":"/audio/7cb18a246fe0397e6233.mp3"}},{"text":"해외로","meaning":"海外，国外","explanation":"해외：海外，国外；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"해외","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62481","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해외로","audio":"/audio/58d83a89f4f1698e3d9c.mp3"}},{"text":"보낸대요.","meaning":"派去，送去，派遣，指派","explanation":"보내다：派去，送去，派遣，指派；ㄴ대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"2","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보낸대요","audio":"/audio/0742d44a90274e36317d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"05ea65477ab09b87","term":"군대","zh":"部队，军队","audio":"/audio/05ea65477ab09b876055.mp3","entryId":"60101","definition":"具有一定的规律和秩序的军人的集体。","pronunciation":["군대"]},{"id":"82862092ebbd4ef9","term":"해외","zh":"海外，国外","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3","entryId":"62481","definition":"不是自己国家，别的国家。","pronunciation":["해ː외","해ː웨"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"派去，送去，派遣，指派","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"因某个任务或目的而让人去某处。","pronunciation":["보내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e7e4ba6ba1e51f48aeda.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57823-1-12-2","ko":"네, 무력 분쟁이 생긴 나라를 돕기 위해 보내다면서요?","zh":"对，说是为了帮助发生武装冲突的国家吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"무력","meaning":"武力","explanation":"무력：武力。","readings":[{"term":"무력","audio":"/audio/21fbd7b4867588e4c31b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57823","senseId":"1","lemma":"무력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무력","audio":"/audio/21fbd7b4867588e4c31b.mp3"}},{"text":"분쟁이","meaning":"纷争，纠纷","explanation":"분쟁：纷争，纠纷；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분쟁","audio":"/audio/572a033094f813ddf3cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60507","senseId":"1","lemma":"분쟁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분쟁이","audio":"/audio/f6279271a3a8d5c6e3e5.mp3"}},{"text":"생긴","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생긴","audio":"/audio/6a1f8f2f14401a79cbc7.mp3"}},{"text":"나라를","meaning":"国，国家","explanation":"나라：国，国家；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나라를","audio":"/audio/c841452ad530697c3ba3.mp3"}},{"text":"돕기","meaning":"援助，救济，扶持","explanation":"돕다：援助，救济，扶持；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"2","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돕기","audio":"/audio/ebcd2e48f7793af3d072.mp3"}},{"text":"위해","meaning":"为了","explanation":"위하다：为了；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"위하다","audio":"/audio/96303fbb42bf3d764fa0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29736","senseId":"1","lemma":"위하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위해","audio":"/audio/6af4158ebe4642d40a9c.mp3"}},{"text":"보내다면서요?","meaning":"派去，送去，派遣，指派","explanation":"보내다：派去，送去，派遣，指派；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"2","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내다면서요","audio":"/audio/9daa8db5a365f92f186b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"21fbd7b4867588e4","term":"무력","zh":"武力","audio":"/audio/21fbd7b4867588e4c31b.mp3","entryId":"57823","definition":"军事力量。","pronunciation":["무ː력"]},{"id":"572a033094f813dd","term":"분쟁","zh":"纷争，纠纷","audio":"/audio/572a033094f813ddf3cf.mp3","entryId":"60507","definition":"互不相让的、激烈的争斗。","pronunciation":["분쟁"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/